<title>LATVIA: Two yields down, one up at Latvian T-bill sale.</title>
<headline>Two yields down, one up at Latvian T-bill sale.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of 28-day and 91-day Latvian T-bills dipped at auction on Wednesday but 182-day paper saw a slight rise in yield, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p>MATURITY  AV YIELD  LAST WEEK  NO OF BANKS  ISSUE  BID SOLD</p>
<p> 28-day     3.95	4.46	   7	    0.75  2.20 0.75</p>
<p> 91-day     5.17	5.19	   9	    1.50  2.38 1.50</p>
<p> 182-day    5.63	5.33	   8	    2.0   2.13 2.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
